config BR2_PACKAGE_CPU_MODELS
	bool "cpu-models"
	default n
	help
	  The person detector majestic's object detection runs on the CPU of
	  cameras without an NPU (HiSilicon/Goke parts with the IVE motion
	  backend): an int8 network majestic's own engine loads from
	  /usr/share/majestic/person.pdnet, with the thresholds of its three
	  presets beside it in person.json. 84 KB. MIT.

	  https://github.com/OpenIPC/cpu-models
